<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Pallet count</title><style>body{font:16px system-ui;max-width:620px;margin:24px;color:#183747}label{display:block;margin:18px 0}input,textarea,button{font:inherit;padding:10px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}small{display:block;color:#52636d}.msg{padding:12px;background:#fff0d8}button{background:#183747;color:white;border:0;border-radius:6px}a{color:#165876}</style></head><body><a href="/inventory/yard">Back to shared map</a><h1><%= pallet.sku_name %></h1><a href="/inventory/yard?copy=<%= pallet.id %>">Copy pallet into empty slots</a><p>Pallet #<%= pallet.id %> &middot; <%= pallet.location_code %><% if(pallet.lot_number){ %> &middot; Lot <%= pallet.lot_number %><% } %></p><% if(msg){ %><p class="msg"><%= msg %></p><% } %><% if(groupItems.length>1){ %><h2>Products on this mixed pallet</h2><% groupItems.forEach(p=>{ %><p><%= p.sku_name %>: <%= p.qty_units %> <%= p.unit_type %> <a href="/inventory/pallet/<%= p.id %>">Edit this product</a></p><% }); %><p>Moving any line moves the whole pallet. Counts below change only the selected product.</p><% } %><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="expected_qty" value="<%= pallet.qty_units %>"><input type="hidden" name="expected_location" value="<%= pallet.location_id %>"><input type="hidden" name="expected_notes" value="<%= pallet.notes || '' %>"><label>Quantity remaining (<%= pallet.unit_type %>)<input type="number" name="qty_units" value="<%= pallet.qty_units %>" min="0" step="any" required></label><small>Zero depletes this product line. The space is freed when every product on the pallet is depleted. This updates the app's inventory count and movement history.</small><label>Notes<textarea name="notes" rows="4"><%= pallet.notes || '' %></textarea></label><label>Your name<input name="user_name" maxlength="100" required></label><small>The name is recorded with this adjustment; it is not a verified user identity.</small><button>Save physical count</button></form><h2>Recent pallet history</h2><% movements.forEach(m=>{ %><p><small><%= m.created_at %> UTC &middot; <%= m.user_name || 'user' %> &middot; <%= m.type %></small><%= m.note || '' %></p><% }); %></body></html>
